spice
* SPICE netlist for the schematic

* Components
I1 1 0 DC i_i      * Current source i_i
Rf 2 6 10k         * Feedback resistor R_F
RL 5 4 1k          * Load resistor R_L
M1 5 2 3 3 NMOS L=1u W=2u

* Nodes
* 1 - Current source positive terminal
* 0 - Ground
* 6 - Common node between R_F and NMOS gate
* 2 - NMOS gate
* 3 - NMOS source (connected to ground)
* 5 - Output node (connected to RL and NMOS drain)
* 4 - Ground reference for RL

.end